    "body": "Yeah, we need to redo the integration with the cookie specification. In particular we want to use the algorithms in https://httpwg.org/http-extensions/draft-ietf-httpbis-layered-cookies.html, probably with some indirection through Fetch. That will then give us back actual change records that we can then use to queue events. And ensure deduplication is done consistently and such.",
